    {
      "id": "claim_1fd27b78ff7e4f5ab642214943b2a35c",
      "statement": "The badge exposes three expansion ports: a Raspberry Pi 40-pin header, an SAO port and a Grove-compatible connector with selectable 3.3 V or 5 V supply.",
