    {
      "id": "claim_23886e0e70194eceba1856aaf288c4c1",
      "statement": "Two slide switches can route Raspberry Pi header pins 24 and 26 to the chip selects of the e-paper display and TROPIC01, with display DC/RST/BUSY on pins 29/31/36 and the TROPIC01 interrupt on pin 37, allowing an external MCU to use both devices.",
